WEEKEND PROJECT 🥽

what if you could play Valve’s Half-Life: Alyx on the Apple Vision Pro?

without a pc, without streaming, running natively on the headset itself? https://t.co/UoZwqWW8vs

this was made possible thanks to valve’s recent linux ARM port of alyx for the steam frame + @ShinyQuagsire’s open source klepton project for running android VR apks on vision pro (which is way too under appreciated btw!)

claude was able to fill in the blanks (technically valve’s ARM port isn’t an android apk but it’s close enough) and then the rest was just optimization work

on my M5 Vision Pro this basically runs at 3K resolution per eye and 60 fps (smoothened up to 120). so essentially way better than it ran on my high-end gaming pc when i first played this in 2020

